button":"btn btn--secondary","enable_color_fade":false,"style_border":"","layout_row_desktop":4,"layout_row_mobile":1,"layout_x_alignment":"justify-between","enable_margin":true,"enable_split":false,"enable_split_heading":false,"visibility":"md:hidden"}},"accordions_LrLbTK":{"type":"accordions","blocks":{"content_KjJnfW":{"type":"content","settings":{"heading":"What makes Jolene Coffee different from other cold brews?","content":"<p>Honestly? Taste it and you'll know. But if you need the details: 24-hour slow brew, premium single-origin beans, filtered water, nothing artificial, no concentrates. We kept it simple because the coffee didn't need anything else.<\/p>","icon":"","color_scheme":"btn","enable_open":true}},"content_Kqy98Q":{"type":"content","settings":{"heading":"How much caffeine is in each can?","content":"<p>Black (Cold Brew) packs 236mg. <br\/>White (Oat Milk Latte) comes in at 118mg. <br\/>Pick your speed.<\/p>","icon":"","color_scheme":"btn","enable_open":false}},"content_3jkmy8":{"type":"content","settings":{"heading":"Are your coffee beans Fair Trade certified?","content":"<p>Always. Fair Trade and Non-GMO certified, sourced from Café Femenino, a women-led collective in Peru. Who grows your coffee matters. We made sure ours were the best.<\/p>","icon":"","color_scheme":"btn","enable_open":false}},"content_ngLB3x":{"type":"content","settings":{"heading":"Do I need to refrigerate Jolene Coffee?","content":"<p>Best served cold. Shelf-stable until opened. Once you crack one, finish it within 24 hours. You weren't going to save half anyway.<\/p>","icon":"","color_scheme":"btn","enable_open":false}},"content_9WdCEU":{"type":"content","settings":{"heading":"Is the Oat Milk Latte gluten-free?","content":"<p>All of it. Gluten-free, dairy-free, Non-GMO. We wanted the White to be smooth enough that you'd never know what's missing. Because nothing is.<\/p>","icon":"","color_scheme":"btn","enable_open":false}},"content_GDRarW":{"type":"content","settings":{"heading":"Can I buy single cans or do I have to order packs?","content":"<p>Both singles and packs. If you're new here, the variety pack is the move. Try both, pick your favorite, come back for more.<\/p>","icon":"","color_scheme":"btn","enable_open":false}}},"block_order":["content_KjJnfW","content_Kqy98Q","content_3jkmy8","content_ngLB3x","content_9WdCEU","content_GDRarW"],"settings":{"heading":"you asked, we answered","content":"","button_label":"","button_url":"","spacing_top":110,"spacing_bottom":110,"color_scheme":"color__bg-body","color_background":"#ffffff","color_text":"","color_border":"color__border-divider-1","color_button":"btn btn--secondary","enable_color_fade":false,"heading_font":"type__body type--base","style_border":"","layout_x_alignment":"justify-between","enable_margin":true,"enable_split":true,"enable_split_heading":false,"visibility":""}},"testimonial_grid_ppc7zf":{"type":"testimonial-grid","blocks":{"testimonial_GdxFz9":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"<p>Jolene Coffee has completely changed my morning routine. The smooth cold brew taste without any bitterness is exactly what I needed. I keep a case in my studio fridge at all times.<\/p>","title":"<p>Marcus T., Music Producer<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Jolene_Coffe_Logo_2.png"}},"testimonial_4m7Eq8":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"<p>Finally, a cold brew that doesn't taste watery or overly acidic. The Black blend has become my go-to for those long creative sessions when I need sustained energy without the jitters.<\/p>","title":"<p>Elena R., Graphic Designer<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Jolene_Coffe_Logo_2.png"}},"testimonial_wUztfP":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"<p>The Oat Milk Latte is perfect for my dietary needs and tastes incredible. It's creamy, smooth, and has just the right amount of coffee flavor. Worth every penny.<\/p>","title":"<p>David K., Creative Director<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Jolene_Coffe_Logo_2.